OL,3,GNEWSARoman coins and cremated remains
OL,4,Afound during dig
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoins, pieces of pottery and a jar of
OL,7,Fcremated remains have been uncovered by
OL,8,Farchaeologists at the site of an old
OL,9,FRoman town next to the River Derwent.
OL,11,FThe items were found during excavations
OL,12,Fin August 2025 and August 2026 at
OL,13,FDarley Playing Fields in Little
OL,14,FChester, which was known by the Romans
OL,15,Fas Derventio.
OL,17,FStudents from York Archaeology, a
OL,18,Fcharity which operates across the UK,
OL,19,Fteamed up with amateur archaeologists
OL,20,Fand Derby Museums during the work.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
