OL,3,GNEWSARoman coins and cremated remains
OL,4,Afound during dig
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Parker, project lead at We Dig
OL,7,FDerventio, said the dig "gave a sense
OL,8,Fof what people were doing 1,800 years
OL,9,Fago".
